{
  "openapi": "3.1.0",
  "info": {
    "title": "SUMOTX Platform API",
    "description": "\n## SUMOTX Platform API \u2014 v0.1\n\n**SUMOTX** exposes a versioned OpenAPI interface for provisioning, training,\nand managing AI workloads on Azure.\n\n### Authentication\n\nAll endpoints (except `GET /v1/health` and `POST /v1/auth/token`) require a\n**Bearer token**.  Exchange your API key for a token via `POST /v1/auth/token`,\nthen include it as:\n\n```\nAuthorization: Bearer <token>\n```\n\n### Versioning\n\nAll endpoints are prefixed with `/v1`.  Breaking changes will be published\nunder a new version prefix.\n\n### API domains\n\n| Domain | Description |\n|---|---|\n| `/v1/auth` | Token issuance |\n| `/v1/projects` | Project / workspace management |\n| `/v1/deployments` | One-click Azure infrastructure provisioning |\n| `/v1/training-runs` | Fine-tuning job lifecycle |\n| `/v1/models` | Model registry |\n| `/v1/chat` | Inference / chat completions |\n| `/v1/health` | Platform health & readiness |\n",
    "contact": {
      "name": "SUMOTX Engineering",
      "url": "https://github.com/orkinosai25-org/SMTX"
    },
    "license": {
      "name": "MIT",
      "url": "https://opensource.org/licenses/MIT"
    },
    "version": "0.1.0"
  },
  "paths": {
    "/v1/health": {
      "get": {
        "tags": [
          "Health"
        ],
        "summary": "Platform health check",
        "description": "Returns the overall platform status and the health of each downstream service (inference, retrieval, verification).  Suitable for Azure health probes, Kubernetes readiness checks, and uptime monitoring.",
        "operationId": "health_v1_health_get",
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Successful Response",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/HealthResponse"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/v1/auth/token": {
      "post": {
        "tags": [
          "Authentication"
        ],
        "summary": "Exchange API key for Bearer token",
        "description": "Validates the supplied API key and returns a short-lived Bearer token. Include the token in subsequent requests as `Authorization: Bearer <token>`. Entra ID / Azure AD integration is planned for a later release.",
        "operationId": "get_token_v1_auth_token_post",
        "requestBody": {
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/TokenRequest"
              }
            }
          },
          "required": true
        },
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Successful Response",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/TokenResponse"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "422": {
            "description": "Validation Error",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
